Subject: [lilith-core-seam] Gate headless computer use through native approval

Route mutating computer-use actions through Hermes' shared approval gate when
the CLI-specific callback is absent. Preserve safe read-only actions, use
action-and-delivery-scoped allowlist keys, accept only native approval choices,
and fail closed on malformed decisions, transport errors, denial, or timeout.

Upstream base: 3c5fd918e3e2537cd74f4f88c990c5de5cbd9f63
